      "proposed_content": "The idempotent decomposition reduces the source's bicomplex zeta constructions to two coordinated classical ones: convergence requires both scalar Dirichlet series, continuation recombines the two scalar continuations, vanishing requires both scalar values to vanish, and the Euler product is inherited when both component products converge.",
